{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">長沙灣連翔道有私家車撞向路邊，有消息指司機懷疑醉駕被捕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">涉事私家車的車身多處受損，安全氣袋彈出，路面有煞車痕跡。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.CSW-0230_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026vAR6AniYa91790633482.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TA.CSW-0230_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">現場是連翔道往葵涌方向，近海麗邨前往昂船洲的路口。事發在凌晨12時許，私家車失控先撞向路邊水馬，再向前衝一段路並轉圈，撞向路邊停下。警方稱司機未有受傷，經檢查後發現體內酒精濃度超標。現場消息表示，其濃度屬最高的第三級，司機涉嫌酒後駕駛被捕。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T22:19:35.620377+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":178,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}